{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"It is written in the Book of Odin:"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,""]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"    After the Creation, the cruel god Moloch rebelled"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"    against the authority of Marduk the Creator."]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"    Moloch stole from Marduk the most powerful of all"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"    the artifacts of the gods, the Amulet of Yendor,"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"    and he hid it in the dark cavities of Gehennom, the"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"    Under World, where he now lurks, and bides his time."]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,""]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"Your god Odin seeks to possess the Amulet, and with it"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"to gain deserved ascendance over the other gods."]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,""]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"You, a newly trained Stripling, have been heralded"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"from birth as the instrument of Odin.  You are destined"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"to recover the Amulet for your deity, or die in the"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"attempt.  Your hour of destiny has come.  For the sake"]}
{"t":"call","name":"putstr","args":[4,0,"of us all:  Go bravely with Odin!"]}
